# Backend Engineering Rules

- Use psycopg2 or asyncpg properly
- Always use transactions
- Always use parameterized queries
- Avoid raw string SQL concatenation
- Validate types before DB insert
- Log migration results
- Do not duplicate logic between apps
- Use reusable helpers inside core/
- Follow multi-app architecture